        <fma:FMAID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5022</fma:FMAID>
        <fma:definition>Nonparenchymatous organ that primarily consists of skeletal muscle tissue aggregated into macroscopic fasciculi by connective tissue; together with other muscles, it constitutes the muscular system. Examples: biceps, diaphragm, masseter, right third external intercostal muscle, external oblique, levator ani, serratus anterior.</fma:definition>
        <fma:non-English_equivalent>Muskel</fma:non-English_equivalent>
        <fma:non-English_equivalent>Músculo</fma:non-English_equivalent>
